meta-own-ros
============

ROS 2 Jazzy layer for the Raspberry Pi 5 image from meta-own. Adds the
counter_demo nodes from ../ros2_ws and builds own-ros-image. See ../README.md
for build instructions.

Dependencies
------------

  meta-own (this repository)

  URI: https://github.com/ros/meta-ros
  layers: meta-ros-common, meta-ros2, meta-ros2-jazzy
  branch: scarthgap

  URI: https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded
  layers: meta-oe, meta-python
  branch: scarthgap

Contents
--------

  recipes-core/images/own-ros-image.bb
      own-image from meta-own plus ros-core, demo-nodes-cpp, counter-demo,
      ros-env and dev-shm.

  recipes-ros/counter-demo/
      Builds the ROS 2 package in ../ros2_ws/src/counter_demo with
      ros_ament_cmake. The sources come from this repository through
      file://, so the host (colcon) and the board build the same code.

  recipes-ros/ros-env/
      /etc/profile.d/ros2.sh: sources /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.sh in login shells.

  recipes-core/dev-shm/
      Init script at S05 that mounts tmpfs on /dev/shm for Fast DDS shared
      memory. sysvinit in poky doesn't mount it, and an fstab entry fails
      because mountall (S03) runs before udev (S04) creates the directory.

  conf/templates/default/
      local.conf and bblayers.conf used for this build, created with
      "bitbake-layers save-build-conf".
